# One local per landscape (docs/STORY.md §8), through the real keys: each stands
# at the village of their own land nearest where he woke, and the one `use` key
# opens their own words. A big world, because a small one is a single island
# that may not have been dealt these lands at all.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/locals.tour --seed=7 --size=1024 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
#
# `at cast:NAME` asks 49_cast where that person stands, never a coordinate.
coast calm
wait 0.6

# --- Pell, a clerk in the city where the plan worked -------------------------------------
at cast:pell
wait 0.8
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 01-pell-files-him with talking,cast:pell
press pause
wait 0.5
await met:pell 2

# --- Mica, raking behind the machines' rakes on the salt ---------------------------------
at cast:mica
wait 0.8
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 02-mica-on-the-salt with talking,cast:mica
press pause
wait 0.5

# --- Brannoc, who listens to the wires over the snow -------------------------------------
at cast:brannoc
wait 0.8
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 03-brannoc-on-the-wires with talking,cast:brannoc
press pause
wait 0.5
await met:brannoc 2
